  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/lieon-studios-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/requires/quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<img width=\"56\"><img width=\"56\"><img width=\"17\"><img width=\"6\"><img width=\"3\"><img width=\"2\"><img width=\"2\"><img width=\"2\"><img width=\"2\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lieonlion.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Shield-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<sup><img width=\"5\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/separator_v.svg\"> pnku:</sup>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pnku.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/pnku_de_logo.svg\" alt=\"pnku.de\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/dividers/horizontal/pnku-top.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>更多盾牌變體</h1>\n<p>現在不僅可以製作每種木材類型的盾牌，每種盾牌變體還有兩種紋理選項可選。<br>\n一方面，有由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fhypothetiKal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hypothetiKal</a> 設計的、針對不同木材類型獨有的自定義紋理；另一方面，還有一種更傳統的紋理，它只是原始盾牌紋理的重新着色版本（該紋理現在用作雲杉盾牌的紋理）。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong><em>可以通過模組的配置文件或使用 Mod Menu 為每個盾牌單獨選擇紋理（自定義或原版風格）。</em></strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/fm8cx.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><sup>展示中的所有紋理 - 在自定義和原版風格之間循環切換 - 使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-armor-stand-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多盔甲架變體</a>。</sup></p>\n<h2>為 Minecraft 添加了 11 個新盾牌物品和 23 種新盾牌紋理！</h2>\n<p>如果您不僅對不同木材的盾牌變體感興趣，還對不同階層/材料的盾牌感興趣，請查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/imb11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">IMB11</a> 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-shields\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Shields</a> 以及我的配套附加模組 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-extra-shield-variants/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Extra Shield Variants</a>，該附加模組為所有從銅到下界合金的盾牌增添了木材變體。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
